  "description": "Cornelia Meitner’s husband is dead. She should be celebrating her newfound freedom, but with no heir to inherit the Marquis title, she’s at risk of losing her estate and the community of staff-turned-friends. To protect her lifestyle, she has only one option: get pregnant as soon as possible. Luckily, a few eligible bachelors are visiting for Marquis Meitner’s funeral, including a dashing young doctor, a lascivious poet, and a callous duke. Who will come out on top in this game of seduction? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
